                    "reading": "luh kohn-seh kohn-stee-too-syoh-nel vehy ah lah kohn-fohr-mee-tay day lwah voh-tay pahr luh pahr-luh-mahn ah-vek luh blohk duh kohn-stee-too-syoh-nah-lee-tay",
