                    "reading": "oh kay-bek, ohn 'bahr lay pohrt doo shahr' ah-vahn duh 'mah-gah-zee-nay', tahn-dee kahn bel-zheek ay ahn sweess, ohn kohnt 'sep-tahnt' ay 'noh-nahnt' ah-vek oon loh-zheek day-see-mahl lan-peed",
